  {
    "id": "example-cover-control-cover-control-example",
    "type": "comment",
    "name": "Cover control example",
    "info": "A position cover (blind, shutter or curtain motor) owned by the cover controller. Requests go in as \"open\", \"close\", \"stop\", a position from 0 to 100, or a preset name; an automatic target sets respectManual so a person's move holds. The function nodes show the mapping to and from a Zigbee2MQTT cover: wire them to MQTT out and in nodes on your cover's topic. Output 3 says whether the cover is moving; here it pauses motion lighting while the cover moves.",
